{
  "info": {
    "name": "POS Toko Alat Tulis API",
    "_postman_id": "510046c7-3f85-43e0-91bc-462bb2ea03e9",
    "description": "REST API sistem kasir toko alat tulis (Laravel 11 + Sanctum).\n\n## Cara pakai\n1. Pilih environment **POS Local** di pojok kanan atas.\n2. Jalankan **1. Autentikasi > Login (admin)**. Token tersimpan otomatis.\n3. Jalankan request lain; semuanya memakai `{{token}}` otomatis.\n\n## Aturan umum\n- Semua request mengirim `Accept: application/json`.\n- Error berbentuk `{\"message\": \"...\"}`; error validasi menyertakan `errors`.\n- `401` tanpa token, `403` bila role tidak cukup, `404` bila tidak ada, `422` bila data salah, `429` bila terlalu sering.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Autentikasi",
      "description": "Daftar dan masuk. Login dibatasi **5 percobaan per menit** (HTTP 429 bila dilampaui). Request login menyimpan token ke environment secara otomatis.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/register",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "register"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mendaftar akun baru. **Role selalu `kasir`**; klien tidak bisa memilih role. Admin dibuat lewat seeder.\n\n**Respons gagal:** `422` bila data tidak valid atau email sudah dipakai; `429` bila terlalu sering.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{$randomFullName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{$randomEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Register berhasil\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (admin)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Masuk sebagai admin. Token disimpan otomatis ke variabel environment `token`.\n\n**Respons gagal:** `422`/`401` untuk kredensial salah; `429` setelah 5 percobaan dalam semenit.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{admin_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login berhasil\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = j.token || (j.data && j.data.token);",
                  "pm.test(\"Token ada di respons\", () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"token\", token);",
                  "console.log(\"Token tersimpan. Sekarang login sebagai admin.\");"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login (kasir)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Masuk sebagai kasir. Menimpa variabel `token`, jadi semua request berikutnya berjalan sebagai kasir.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{kasir_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{kasir_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Login berhasil\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const token = j.token || (j.data && j.data.token);",
                  "pm.test(\"Token ada di respons\", () => pm.expect(token).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"token\", token);",
                  "console.log(\"Token tersimpan. Sekarang login sebagai kasir.\");"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Profil saya (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/me",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Profil pengguna yang sedang login. Tidak pernah menyertakan password.\n\n**Akses:** login."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Mencabut token yang sedang dipakai. Setelah ini token tidak berlaku lagi.\n\n**Akses:** login."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Logout berhasil\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 204]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
